This project contains code adapted from toad
(https://github.com/batrachianai/toad), Copyright (c) Will McGugan,
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0:

- src/acptui/ui/render.py: `pill()` (from toad's src/toad/pill.py)
- src/acptui/ui/widgets/blocks.py: `PlanView` (status icons and priority pills,
  after toad's src/toad/widgets/plan.py) and the tool output heuristic in
  `_text_widget` (ANSI / Markdown / plain text, after toad's
  src/toad/widgets/tool_call.py)
- src/acptui/shell.py: the pseudo-terminal shell of shell mode (setsid and the
  controlling terminal, the working directory reported by an escape sequence; after
  toad's src/toad/shell.py), and switching the prompt to shell mode with `!` / `$`
  (after toad's src/toad/widgets/prompt.py)
- src/acptui/config.py: the agent list `_TOAD_AGENTS` (names, commands, homepages and
  install / login commands from toad's src/toad/data/agents/*.toml)
- src/acptui/ui/widgets/sidebar.py: the sidebar (collapsible plan and project
  sections docked at the left, after toad's src/toad/widgets/side_bar.py and
  src/toad/screens/main.tcss)
- src/acptui/ui/screens/picker.py: pinned agents started with number keys (after
  toad's launcher, "show in launcher", src/toad/screens/store.py and agent_modal.py)
- src/acptui/data/sounds/question.wav, turn-over.wav: toad's notification sounds
  (src/toad/data/sounds/), resampled to 22 kHz mono and shortened

The protocol layer (ACP v2 via aclientp) and the other widgets are new code.
